q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (Our aim is to implement a manageable database application for Hardware World. Our objectives are to) Tj T* (maintain organized records, process sales and deliveries atomically, record payroll, generate ledger) Tj T* (entries, enforce access roles and support recovery through CSV backups.) Tj T* ET
Q
