BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (The application is an educational implementation. It records global product stock rather than stock per) Tj T* (branch. It does not implement refunds, tax calculations, customer credit, statutory payroll calculations or) Tj T* (a full double-entry accounting system.) Tj T* ET
